From: Xiaobei09 <xiaobei09@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 16:10:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] feat: add force-stream and compat-tools inputs for
 free-tier compatibility

Some OpenAI-compatible free tiers (verified against OpenCode Zen) only admit
requests that use SSE streaming and carry at least two tool definitions.
Neither is true of robin's default non-router path, which calls
blockingChatCompletion with no tools.

- force-stream: route non-router models through streamChatCompletion.
- compat-tools: inject two placeholder tool definitions with
  tool_choice=none, so the tools are never invoked.
